  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "31404398",
      "title": "Managing Form State & Submission",
      "lectureOrder": 153,
      "videoOrder": 149,
      "sourceHash": "42ec0d5579d5951d3e040c9ad0b943b036bb19f93bb50e745f16c7779efe9eea",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.27,
          "end": 5.63,
          "en": "So let's now deal with form submission.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.63,
          "end": 8.27,
          "en": "Now, as always, there of course are multiple ways",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.27,
          "end": 9.77,
          "en": "of handling that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.77,
          "end": 13.27,
          "en": "At the moment, it is worth noting that we actually handle",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.27,
          "end": 15.69,
          "en": "the form submission in ManageExpense.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.69,
          "end": 18.053,
          "en": "There, I have this confirm button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.24,
          "end": 23.73,
          "en": "Now we could keep it here and simply manage our form state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.73,
          "end": 27,
          "en": "in this Component instead of ExpenseForm.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 27,
          "end": 29.53,
          "en": "So we moved that state management up",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 29.53,
          "end": 32.85,
          "en": "and we then passed the event of entered text around",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 32.85,
          "end": 34.49,
          "en": "with props.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 34.49,
          "end": 36.59,
          "en": "But actually to me, it makes more sense",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 36.59,
          "end": 39.83,
          "en": "to manage the form state here in ExpenseForm",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 40.89,
          "end": 43.46,
          "en": "and to also manage the form submission there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 43.46,
          "end": 45.72,
          "en": "because the form submission belongs to the form,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 45.72,
          "end": 47.77,
          "en": "at least in my opinion.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 47.77,
          "end": 51.47,
          "en": "Therefore what I will do, is I will grab this here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 51.47,
          "end": 54.26,
          "en": "This view from ManageExpense,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 54.26,
          "end": 55.973,
          "en": "this view which holds my buttons,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 57.23,
          "end": 60.053,
          "en": "and I will move it here into the ExpenseForm Component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 60.97,
          "end": 64.393,
          "en": "There we can add it below all our inputs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 65.93,
          "end": 67.083,
          "en": "For example, here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 68.03999999999999,
          "end": 69.77,
          "en": "Now, of course, we also need to bring",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 69.77,
          "end": 74.4,
          "en": "over the styles and imports to our custom button Component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 74.4,
          "end": 77.61,
          "en": "I'll start with the import so that I don't forget it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 77.61,
          "end": 82.61,
          "en": "And I'll import Button from, going up one level, UI Button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 82.67,
          "end": 83.503,
          "en": "Like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 84.41,
          "end": 87.41,
          "en": "Now to also migrate the styles here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 87.41,
          "end": 91.05,
          "en": "I need the buttons and button style.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 91.05,
          "end": 95.13,
          "en": "So these are the styles I will cut from ManageExpense.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 95.13,
          "end": 97.33,
          "en": "The other styles are still needed here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 97.33,
          "end": 99.93,
          "en": "but I will cut those styles.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 99.93,
          "end": 103.67,
          "en": "And now in ExpenseForm, we can add those styles here maybe",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 103.67,
          "end": 105.493,
          "en": "at the bottom, doesn't matter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 106.36,
          "end": 108.41,
          "en": "And with that, that should still work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 108.41,
          "end": 109.53999999999999,
          "en": "Though, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 109.53999999999999,
          "end": 113.973,
          "en": "we won't find these functions that should be executed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 115.11,
          "end": 118.47,
          "en": "Now, therefore, we might wanna re-add those functions,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 118.47,
          "end": 120.97,
          "en": "but actually that's not quite the case.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 120.97,
          "end": 124.56,
          "en": "I do wanna handle the submission here in this Component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 124.56,
          "end": 127.62,
          "en": "So I will add this confirmHandler.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 127.62,
          "end": 132.233,
          "en": "Though I will name it, submitHandler, but that is optional.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 133.27,
          "end": 136.13,
          "en": "But regarding the cancelHandler,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 136.13,
          "end": 139.02,
          "en": "that doesn't have to be handled in this Component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 139.02,
          "end": 142.01,
          "en": "because in the cancelHandler, we are in the end",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 142.01,
          "end": 144.37,
          "en": "only closing that overlay modal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 144.37,
          "end": 145.763,
          "en": "We're just going back.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 146.74,
          "end": 148.01,
          "en": "And I still wanna do this here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 148.01,
          "end": 149.87,
          "en": "in the ManageExpense Component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 149.87,
          "end": 152.57,
          "en": "because it makes sense to manage the overall screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 152.57,
          "end": 155.263,
          "en": "that opened up in that screen Component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 156.32999999999998,
          "end": 158.14,
          "en": "Therefore, in ExpenseForm,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 158.14,
          "end": 163.14,
          "en": "I simply expect to get props here in my custom Component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 163.21,
          "end": 166.67000000000002,
          "en": "and I do expect to get an onCancel prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 166.67000000000002,
          "end": 171.43,
          "en": "I also expect to get an onSubmit prop here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 171.43,
          "end": 174.32,
          "en": "and the onCancel prop will be important now",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 174.32,
          "end": 177.55,
          "en": "because down here on this cancel button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 177.55,
          "end": 179.98,
          "en": "I will just use onCancel.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 179.98,
          "end": 182.47,
          "en": "So I expect to get a function as a value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 182.47,
          "end": 183.97,
          "en": "on this onCancel prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 183.97,
          "end": 187.163,
          "en": "And I will then connect this function to this button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 188.37,
          "end": 190.19,
          "en": "Now for the other button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 190.19,
          "end": 193.32,
          "en": "I will point at my newly added submitHandler",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 193.32,
          "end": 195.65,
          "en": "and we will work with the onSubmit prop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 195.65,
          "end": 198.36,
          "en": "which I also added a little bit later.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 198.36,
          "end": 201.45,
          "en": "In ManageExpense, we now just have to make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 201.45,
          "end": 204.57999999999998,
          "en": "that we pass onCancel to the ExpenseForm",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 205.747,
          "end": 208.363,
          "en": "and that we point at our cancelHandler here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 209.65,
          "end": 212.59,
          "en": "With that, if we save everything and reload everything,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 212.59,
          "end": 215.45,
          "en": "it should work again, except for the fact",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 215.45,
          "end": 219.52,
          "en": "that I'm relying on isEditing, which I'm not getting.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 219.52,
          "end": 222.96,
          "en": "So, we actually, of course, need to pass this down as well",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 222.96,
          "end": 225.86,
          "en": "because here I'm using isEditing to control",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 225.86,
          "end": 228.43,
          "en": "whether we are updating or adding.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 228.43,
          "end": 230.72,
          "en": "And actually here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 230.72,
          "end": 233.863,
          "en": "I expect to get my submitButtonLabel,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 235.79,
          "end": 237.43,
          "en": "as a prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 237.43,
          "end": 242.08,
          "en": "So I will use submitButtonLabel as a prop on my ExpenseForm",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 242.08,
          "end": 243.833,
          "en": "and add this as a prop here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 244.75,
          "end": 246.63,
          "en": "And in ManageExpense,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 246.63,
          "end": 249.98,
          "en": "I will therefore then set my submitButtonLabel.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 249.98,
          "end": 252.9,
          "en": "And then here we can use the same logic as before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 252.9,
          "end": 255.28,
          "en": "where we check isEditing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 255.28,
          "end": 259.303,
          "en": "If we are, I say Update, otherwise I say Add.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 260.2,
          "end": 261.5,
          "en": "So that's a way of making sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 261.5,
          "end": 263.16,
          "en": "that we still set the right label.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 263.16,
          "end": 267.25,
          "en": "But I still wanna have the logic for that in ManageExpense.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 267.25,
          "end": 270.77,
          "en": "Though, we could have also passed isEditing to ExpenseForm.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 270.77,
          "end": 272.57,
          "en": "That would've been fine as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 272.57,
          "end": 275.97,
          "en": "And with that, now we should be able to open this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 275.97,
          "end": 276.803,
          "en": "Here we go.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 276.803,
          "end": 279.02,
          "en": "And I can still close it and cancel it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 279.02,
          "end": 280.98,
          "en": "This works as before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 280.98,
          "end": 283.13,
          "en": "Of course, also on Android.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 283.13,
          "end": 286.04,
          "en": "But now we also actually will be able",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 286.04,
          "end": 289.94,
          "en": "to do a bit more once the form is submitted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 289.94,
          "end": 292.233,
          "en": "And that is there for what we will do next.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
